{
  "endpoint": "GET /orders/{id}/events (Server-Sent Events)",
  "note": "Replays the order's past events, then streams new ones until settled or failed. Each event: event: <type>\\ndata: <json>\\n\\n. token events carry generated text so a client renders one continuous answer across a move. ': ping' every 15 seconds.",
